{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "marvaron-auth-001",
		"name": "MARVRON - Auth APIs",
		"description": "# MARVRON Auth API\n\n## Base URL\nSet **`base_url`** (Collection → Variables). Default: EC2 deploy. No trailing slash.\n\n## Collection variables\n| Variable | Use |\n|----------|-----|\n| `base_url` | e.g. `http://localhost:8080` or your server |\n| `token` | JWT after login / register complete (auto-saved) |\n| `registration_token` | Short-lived token after step 1 (auto-saved) |\n\n## JWT\nAccess token includes **`role`** (active) and **`roles`** (all enabled). After **Switch active role** or **Enable role**, save the new `token` from the response.\n\n## Flows\n1. **Multi-step signup:** Register profile → Register password (Bearer `registration_token`) → Verify phone OTP → JWT in `token`.\n2. **Legacy:** `POST .../register` with password + role in one request.\n3. **Login:** `POST .../login` with email + password (requires completed registration).\n\n## Roles (self-service)\n`customer` (default), `distributor`, `courier`, `vendor`. Use **Enable role** then **Switch active role**. `admin` / `super_admin` are not self-service.\n\n## OTP\nStored in **Redis** if configured, else **PostgreSQL** (`OTPRecord`). Dev: OTP is printed in **server logs**.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "bearer",
		"bearer": [
			{
				"key": "token",
				"value": "{{token}}",
				"type": "string"
			}
		]
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "http://98.92.77.116:8080"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": ""
		},
		{
			"key": "registration_token",
			"value": ""
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "01 Registration (multi-step)",
			"description": "Default role: **customer**. Step 2–3 use `Authorization: Bearer {{registration_token}}` or pass `registration_token` in JSON.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1 Register profile",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.registration_token) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('registration_token', json.registration_token);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Jane Doe\",\n  \"phone\": \"+15551234567\",\n  \"email\": \"jane@example.com\",\n  \"street_address\": \"123 Main St\",\n  \"city\": \"New York\",\n  \"state\": \"NY\",\n  \"post_code\": \"10001\",\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"marketing_opt_in\": false\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register/profile",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register", "profile"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/register/profile`\n\nRequired: full_name, phone, email, street_address, city, state, post_code, country.\n\n**Response:** `registration_token`, `user_id`, `next_step: password`."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "2 Register password + referral",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.registration_token) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('registration_token', json.registration_token);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{registration_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"referral_code\": \"\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register/password",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register", "password"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/register/password`\n\nBearer: **registration_token** (or body `registration_token`).\n\nSets password; optional **referral_code** (another user's code). Sends OTP to **phone** from step 1. Call again to **resend OTP** if password already set."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "3 Verify phone (complete signup)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
							{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{registration_token}}" }
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"otp\": \"000000\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register/verify-phone",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register", "verify-phone"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/register/verify-phone`\n\nBearer: **registration_token**. Body: **otp** from server logs (dev) or SMS provider.\n\n**Response:** JWT → saved to `token`; user gets **referral_code**."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "02 Session (login & legacy register)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register (legacy one-step)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"full_name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"first_name\": \"John\",\n  \"last_name\": \"Doe\",\n  \"phone\": \"+1234567890\",\n  \"street_address\": \"1 Market St\",\n  \"city\": \"San Francisco\",\n  \"state\": \"CA\",\n  \"post_code\": \"94105\",\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"role\": \"customer\",\n  \"referral_code\": \"\",\n  \"marketing_opt_in\": false\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "register"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/register`\n\n**role:** `customer` | `distributor` | `courier` | `vendor`\n\nOptional: address fields, **referral_code** (referrer's code). Returns JWT immediately."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/login`\n\nEmail + password. Fails if multi-step registration not finished (`registration_complete`)."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "03 OTP (general)",
			"description": "For logged-in-style OTP flows (not the register/verify-phone step). Requires completed registration for **verify** to return JWT.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Send OTP",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"method\": \"email\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/otp/send",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "otp", "send"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/otp/send`\n\n**identifier:** email or phone. **method:** `email` | `sms` (logged in dev)."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Verify OTP",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"customer@example.com\",\n  \"otp\": \"123456\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/otp/verify",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "otp", "verify"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/otp/verify`\n\nReturns JWT only if user exists **and** registration is complete."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "04 Profile & account",
			"description": "Uses collection **Bearer {{token}}**.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get Profile",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/profile",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "profile"]
						},
						"description": "`GET /api/v1/auth/profile`\n\nReturns `user`, `roles`, `active_role`."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Update Profile",
					"request": {
						"method": "PUT",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"full_name\": \"Jane Q. Doe\",\n  \"phone\": \"+0987654321\",\n  \"street_address\": \"456 Oak Ave\",\n  \"city\": \"Brooklyn\",\n  \"state\": \"NY\",\n  \"post_code\": \"11201\",\n  \"country\": \"US\",\n  \"marketing_opt_in\": true\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/profile",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "profile"]
						},
						"description": "`PUT /api/v1/auth/profile`\n\nAll fields optional: full_name, first_name, last_name, phone, street_address, city, state, post_code, country, marketing_opt_in."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Close Account",
					"request": {
						"method": "DELETE",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/account",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "account"]
						},
						"description": "`DELETE /api/v1/auth/account`\n\nSoft-deactivates user (`is_active: false`)."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "05 Roles",
			"description": "**Enable role** adds distributor/courier/vendor. **Switch active role** sets JWT `role` to one you already have.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Enable role — distributor",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"distributor\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/roles/enable",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "roles", "enable"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/roles/enable` — body `{ \"role\": \"distributor\" }`. Creates **Distributor** row if missing."
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Enable role — courier",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"courier\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/roles/enable",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "roles", "enable"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/roles/enable` — `{ \"role\": \"courier\" }`"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Enable role — vendor",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"role\": \"vendor\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/roles/enable",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "roles", "enable"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/roles/enable` — `{ \"role\": \"vendor\" }`"
					}
				},
				{
					"name": "Switch active role",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.token); }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"active_role\": \"customer\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/switch-role",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "switch-role"]
						},
						"description": "`POST /api/v1/auth/switch-role`\n\n**active_role** must be in your **roles** (e.g. customer, distributor, courier, vendor). Cannot switch to admin here. Returns new JWT."
					}
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "06 Health",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Health Check",
					"request": {
						"auth": { "type": "noauth" },
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/health",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["health"]
						},
						"description": "`GET /health` — no auth."
					}
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
